\end{align*}
where we used $\frac{q_k}{\beta_k (1-\beta_k)} = \frac{q_{k+1}}{\beta_k} > (1+2\alpha\mu)^k$.

Now it only remains to show that $V_N \ge 0$ holds for any $N \in \mathbb{N}$; if that is the case, then
